{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Container Terminal Simulator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/4bd54a8a320f86794a8236cf35f70762.avif?t=1773872260\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Container Terminal Simulator</strong> is a detailed railway cargo terminal management simulator that combines hands-on machinery operation, deep economic systems, and a living world that reacts to your decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small rail yard and basic equipment, then grow it into a powerful logistics hub. Expand infrastructure, optimize cargo flow, upgrade machinery, and build an efficient freight business step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take Full Control of a Growing Terminal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the manager of a fast-developing railway container terminal, where every decision directly affects efficiency, profits, and long-term strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From unloading your first 20-foot containers with basic tools to handling complex operations with heavy forklifts, long trains, and vehicle acceptance \u2014 <strong>you control the entire workflow</strong>, from arrival to departure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Game Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Economy and Resource Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success depends on smart economic decisions.<br>Sell cargo, upgrade equipment, manage rentals, plan logistics routes, and monitor operational costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The economy is based on realistic parameters:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Container type and size</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weight and handling complexity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughput efficiency</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Downtime and delays</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimization is the key to higher profits and terminal growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf99 <strong>Integrated Voice Assistant</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique voiced assistant supports you during operations.<br>System messages, actions, and terminal events are fully voiced in <strong>English, Spanish, and Russian</strong>, making management more intuitive and immersive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional language support is planned for future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1e <strong>Dynamic Time of Day</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The terminal never sleeps.<br>Experience a full day-night cycle \u2014 from bright daylight to evening shadows and night operations. Lighting changes affect visibility, atmosphere, and the overall feeling of working on a real industrial site.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/0ce55f282d8967ee71ee4f660cdfed09.poster.avif?t=1773872260\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/0ce55f282d8967ee71ee4f660cdfed09.webm?t=1773872260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/0ce55f282d8967ee71ee4f660cdfed09.mp4?t=1773872260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Living World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your terminal exists inside an active environment.<br>Trains pass nearby, aircraft fly overhead, ambient transport sounds surround the area, and the world becomes more alive as your infrastructure expands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress doesn\u2019t just unlock mechanics \u2014 it <strong>visibly transforms the world around you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcca <strong>Advanced Statistics &amp; Analytics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track every detail of your operation:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Containers processed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Efficiency and throughput</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revenue and expenses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment downtime</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear charts, reports, and period comparisons help you identify bottlenecks and improve performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>Progression &amp; Expansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin with a small office and a single railway line. As you grow, you unlock:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for 40-foot containers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicle acceptance mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Longer trains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional railway tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded trade and store systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automated control solutions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each upgrade opens new logistical challenges and shapes your management style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/baf0e5bd1eae65d6d8668056c596ef6b.poster.avif?t=1773872260\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/baf0e5bd1eae65d6d8668056c596ef6b.webm?t=1773872260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/baf0e5bd1eae65d6d8668056c596ef6b.mp4?t=1773872260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude9a <strong>Machinery &amp; Cargo Variety</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle a wide range of cargo types:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard and household goods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refrigerated containers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous and specialized cargo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prefabricated and industrial freight</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use multiple classes of loaders \u2014 from entry-level machines to heavy industrial equipment.<br>Each container has weight, value, and handling requirements, making every operation unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/c7d52181b00f47f30453c1e05d36fc9d.poster.avif?t=1773872260\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/c7d52181b00f47f30453c1e05d36fc9d.webm?t=1773872260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/c7d52181b00f47f30453c1e05d36fc9d.mp4?t=1773872260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Who Is This Game For?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of management and construction simulators</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who enjoy realistic logistics and optimization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those who want a calm but deep gameplay experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone fascinated by railway transport and cargo operations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Future Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The project is actively evolving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Already implemented:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced assistant (EN / ES / RU)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic day-night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working economic system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic transport and logistics logic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planned updates:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer co-op (shared terminal management)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded world and infrastructure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New scenarios and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional language support (German, French, and more)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The containers are arriving.</strong><br><br><strong>The rails are loaded.</strong><br><br><strong>The machines are ready.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, manage, and grow your terminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Container Terminal Simulator.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Are you serious?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806270/7c0bd2fe5ba92fe1ff81aecfca3044ad1ed6be03.jpg"},{"name":"First step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806270/994f4aed7cfbd6f73538166e905f59ffa297c4e9.jpg"},{"name":"Home sweet home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806270/24163b6dda1b742226155bdf54145b27af186d71.jpg"},{"name":"Trick or truck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806270/861b71a17604ed3853f3e1a137484e41f528b8f7.jpg"},{"name":"Millioner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806270/4b786ebc04201d8a06dce369b60094868be5df30.jpg"},{"name":"X-ray man?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806270/a907bb9736338904c0bdb0b69bad1333b32e9574.jpg"},{"name":"One is good, but two are better","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806270/dd18f422fdb34b4eace3ff049c3561119719c719.jpg"},{"name":"Lord of terminal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806270/66cbb41abb9e41cdf6d300a065ed62d3fa8f4de7.jpg"},{"name":"CTS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806270/a91ef9abe4bf9b6354b346efba7e9c2b5d98ec4e.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect Timing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3806270/3ed3a46036a126314fff5744162446022c4eba89.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806270?t=1773872260","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/367e4d139ff93a6c10f37f0134e93c3e0ebb5009/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773872260","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/b5e14da5b718f0ab7aab491d638f35b0333f83bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773872260","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/b5e14da5b718f0ab7aab491d638f35b0333f83bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773872260","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Container Terminal Simulator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/4bd54a8a320f86794a8236cf35f70762.avif?t=1773872260\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Container Terminal Simulator</strong> is a detailed railway cargo terminal management simulator that combines hands-on machinery operation, deep economic systems, and a living world that reacts to your decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small rail yard and basic equipment, then grow it into a powerful logistics hub. Expand infrastructure, optimize cargo flow, upgrade machinery, and build an efficient freight business step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take Full Control of a Growing Terminal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the manager of a fast-developing railway container terminal, where every decision directly affects efficiency, profits, and long-term strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From unloading your first 20-foot containers with basic tools to handling complex operations with heavy forklifts, long trains, and vehicle acceptance \u2014 <strong>you control the entire workflow</strong>, from arrival to departure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Game Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Economy and Resource Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success depends on smart economic decisions.<br>Sell cargo, upgrade equipment, manage rentals, plan logistics routes, and monitor operational costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The economy is based on realistic parameters:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Container type and size</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weight and handling complexity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughput efficiency</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Downtime and delays</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimization is the key to higher profits and terminal growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf99 <strong>Integrated Voice Assistant</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique voiced assistant supports you during operations.<br>System messages, actions, and terminal events are fully voiced in <strong>English, Spanish, and Russian</strong>, making management more intuitive and immersive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional language support is planned for future updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1e <strong>Dynamic Time of Day</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The terminal never sleeps.<br>Experience a full day-night cycle \u2014 from bright daylight to evening shadows and night operations. Lighting changes affect visibility, atmosphere, and the overall feeling of working on a real industrial site.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/0ce55f282d8967ee71ee4f660cdfed09.poster.avif?t=1773872260\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/0ce55f282d8967ee71ee4f660cdfed09.webm?t=1773872260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/0ce55f282d8967ee71ee4f660cdfed09.mp4?t=1773872260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Living World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your terminal exists inside an active environment.<br>Trains pass nearby, aircraft fly overhead, ambient transport sounds surround the area, and the world becomes more alive as your infrastructure expands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress doesn\u2019t just unlock mechanics \u2014 it <strong>visibly transforms the world around you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcca <strong>Advanced Statistics &amp; Analytics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track every detail of your operation:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Containers processed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Efficiency and throughput</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revenue and expenses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment downtime</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear charts, reports, and period comparisons help you identify bottlenecks and improve performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>Progression &amp; Expansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin with a small office and a single railway line. As you grow, you unlock:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for 40-foot containers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicle acceptance mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Longer trains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional railway tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded trade and store systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automated control solutions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each upgrade opens new logistical challenges and shapes your management style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/extras/baf0e5bd1eae65d6d8668056c596ef6b.poster.avif?t=1773872260\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https: