calm but deep gameplay experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone fascinated by railway transport and cargo operations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Future Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The project is actively evolving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Already implemented:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced assistant (EN / ES / RU)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic day-night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working economic system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic transport and logistics logic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planned updates:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer co-op (shared terminal management)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded world and infrastructure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New scenarios and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional language support (German, French, and more)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The containers are arriving.</strong><br><br><strong>The rails are loaded.</strong><br><br><strong>The machines are ready.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, manage, and grow your terminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Container Terminal Simulator.</strong></p>","developers":["Tikam Studio"],"dlc":[3888280],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806270/5aadf0dacd883a8eeb4d7de735fbf435abbae055/header.jpg?t=1773872260","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong>